; Level 7. WARDEN upgrades to SWARM (particle filter). Teaches: the particle cloud, mirrors (false sightings, blind spots).
; The airlock terminal sits in front of a camera: stand there unseen, or make the camera see you somewhere else.
title: Optics
zone: R&D Labs
tracker: particle
par: 240
banner: ADMINISTRATION BREACH. LAB TRACKING: SWARM v4. 500 HYPOTHESES ONLINE.
botroute: MTX
map:
##########################################
#S...#...........#.........#,,,,,,,,,,,,,#
#....#....1......#....M....#,,,,,,,,,,,,,#
#....#...........#.........#,,,,,,,,,,,,,#
#.......a.........................b...,,,#
#....#...........#.........#,,,,,,,,,,,,,#
##.###.....W.....#####.#####,,,,,,,,,,,,,#
#...............................u..T....V#
#..o.........#########.#########.##E######
#....G.......#.......#.#.......#.#.....2.#
#..c.........#...3...#.#.......#.#....X..#
#............#.......#.#.......#.#.......#
