entities:
note 1 kind=whiteboard text="SWARM v4: 500 guesses. Each one a hypothesis. The likely ones multiply, the rest die. (Someone has drawn a sad face next to a dying dot.)"
note 2 kind=sticky text="Airlock camera can't tell a person from a reflection. Facilities says mirrors STAY in the optics lab."
note 3 kind=whiteboard text="Subject calibration log. C-3: caught. C-5: caught. C-7: ESCAPED x4. 'C-7 evades by managing what the cameras can see.'"
pickup M tool=mirror
camera W dir=0 range=9
camera V dir=180 range=9
swivel u from=180 to=300 period=7 range=7
terminal T opens=E
door E
guard G route=abc
